<div>
<p class="text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-primary font-black">《人类简史》原文节选</p>
<h3 class="text-lg font-black text-white mt-1">农业革命：奢侈陷阱</h3>
</div>
<button id="close-sapiens-excerpt-top" data-no-next="" class="h-8 w-8 rounded-lg border border-white/10 text-gray-300 hover:text-white hover:bg-white/5 transition-colors">×</button>
</div>
<div class="px-6 py-5 space-y-4 max-h-[60vh] overflow-y-auto text-sm text-gray-300 leading-relaxed">
<p>“农业革命是一场惊天骗局。” 这一判断并不是否定粮食产量的增长，而是在追问：个体人类是否因此更幸福。</p>
<p>在狩猎采集时代，多数人每日劳动时间更短，饮食来源更多样，身体承受的重复性损伤也更少。进入农业社会后，人类为了保障单一作物，必须投入更长劳动时间，承担更高风险。</p>
<p>从物种演化的角度看，小麦无疑是赢家；但从个体体验的角度看，许多人却陷入“高产出、低幸福”的生存结构，这就是所谓“奢侈的陷阱”。</p>
<p>你在本幕要观察的重点不是“粮食是不是更多了”，而是“更多粮食”是否真的转化为了“更好的生活”。</p>
</div>
<div class="px-6 py-4 border-t border-white/10 flex justify-end">
<button id="close-sapiens-excerpt" data-no-next="" class="px-5 py-2.5 rounded-lg bg-primary text-white text-sm font-black hover:bg-primary-dark transition-colors">我已阅读，返回模拟</button>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<script>
(() => {
  const openBtn = document.getElementById("open-sapiens-excerpt");
  const modal = document.getElementById("sapiens-excerpt-modal");
  const closeBtn = document.getElementById("close-sapiens-excerpt");
  const closeTopBtn = document.getElementById("close-sapiens-excerpt-top");
  if (!openBtn || !modal || !closeBtn || !closeTopBtn) return;

  const openModal = () => {
    modal.classList.remove("hidden");
    modal.classList.add("flex");
  };
  const closeModal = () => {
    modal.classList.add("hidden");
    modal.classList.remove("flex");
  };

  openBtn.addEventListener("click", (event) => {
    event.preventDefault();
    openModal();
  });
  closeBtn.addEventListener("click", closeModal);
  closeTopBtn.addEventListener("click", closeModal);
  modal.addEventListener("click", (event) => {
    if (event.target === modal) closeModal();
  });
})();
</script>

</body></html>
