nceptual implications, not universal proof claims.","optionA":{"stance":"Conservative precisi","label":"Revise to say the pilot explores hybrid aesthetic experience and documents varie","feedback":"Trust rises because your public language matches the evidence boundaries.","effects":{"stability":4,"treasury":0,"reform":3}},"optionB":{"stance":"Overclaim","label":"Approve bold claims that sonification solves access for everyone.","feedback":"The message travels fast, but credibility becomes fragile under scrutiny.","effects":{"stability":-5,"treasury":1,"reform":2}}}];
