<body>
  <main class="page">
    <aside class="panel side">
      <h2>Transformer论文学习战役</h2>
      <p class="small">1 / 1 · 模块一：总攻前夜——读懂Transformer的四个齿轮</p>
      <p class="small">角色：你将扮演：模型研究小队指挥官（兼课程设计者）</p>
      <p class="small">世界：场景设定在“神经网络联合指挥部”沙盘室。你手中只有论文摘要信息与个人笔记，需要通过三轮关键决策，组织一次可执行的学习战役方案。</p>
      <p class="small">你被任命为“序列前线”的新任首席研读官，要在有限时间内把《Attention Is All You Need》的核心机制讲清、讲透、讲得能落地。</p>

      <div class="stat">
        <label><span>系统稳定度</span><span id="s-v">50</span></label>
        <div class="bar"><div id="s-b" class="fill s"></div></div>
      </div>
      <div class="stat">
        <label><span>资源活性</span><span id="t-v">50</span></label>
        <div class="bar"><div id="t-b" class="fill t"></div></div>
      </div>
      <div class="stat">
        <label><span>结构推进</span><span id="r-v">50</span></label>
        <div class="bar"><div id="r-b" class="fill r"></div></div>
      </div>

      <section class="intel">
        <h2>情报卡</h2>
        <p class="small">本关目标：让小队形成连贯认知：从单次注意力计算到多头机制，再到位置编码与编码器-解码器整体拼装。</p>
        <ul><li>情报卡A：论文核心表述是“基于自注意力，移除循环与卷积主干”。</li><li>情报卡B：你的笔记列出四个学习锚点：缩放点积注意力、多头注意力、位置编码、编码器-解码器堆叠。</li><li>情报卡C：在来源有限时，应强调机制关系与设计动机，避免捏造精确数值对比。</li><li>情报卡D：本关目标是“形成可讲授框架”，不是复现实验全细节。</li></ul>
      </section>

      <section class="log">
        <h2>事件日志</h2>
        <ul id="event-log"></ul>
      </section>
    </aside>

    <section class="main">
      <header class="hero">
        <div class="chip-row">
          <span class="chip">研究任务局</span>
          <span class="chip">深夜作战室，投影墙循环显示论文标题与结构图。你要在晨会前给出一版“可信且不过度推断”的教学战术。</span>
          <span class="chip">任务 1</span>
        </div>
        <h1>模块一：总攻前夜——读懂Transformer的四个齿轮</h1>
        <p class="sub">警报灯转为蓝色，意味着你有一次完整推演机会。你的每个选择都会影响小队的理解稳定度、时间预算与改革推进速度。</p>
        <p class="mission">主线任务：在不夸大论文结论的前提下，构建一条从注意力计算到整体架构的学习路径，让小队理解Transformer为何能在设计上摆脱循环与卷积。</p>
      </header>

      <p class="mentor">导师“Archivist Lin”提醒：我们只依据论文摘要与现有笔记做保守解读，不虚构具体实验统计细节。</p>

      <article class="scenario">
        <h3 id="round-title"></h3>
        <p id="round-situation" class="situation"></p>
        <p id="round-prompt" class="prompt"></p>
        <p id="round-hint" class="hint"></p>

        <div class="options">
          <button id="opt-a" class="opt-btn">
            <span id="opt-a-stance" class="opt-stance"></span>
            <span id="opt-a-label" class="opt-label"></span>
            <span id="opt-a-effect" class="opt-effect"></span>
          </button>
          <button id="opt-b" class="opt-btn">
            <span id="opt-b-stance" class="opt-stance"></span>
            <span id="opt-b-label" class="opt-label"></span>
            <span id="opt-b-effect" class="opt-effect"></span>
          </button>
        </div>
      </article>

      <p id="report" class="report"></p>

      <div id="debrief" class="debrief">
        <p>推演结束后，你将得到一份可直接用于授课的主线：先算注意力，再扩展到多头，最后拼装进完整Transformer框架，并反复强调“保守结论边界”。</p>
        <p>高质量论文学习，不在于背术语，而在于用有限证据组织可信叙事。</p>
      </div>
      <div id="end-actions" class="end-actions">
        <a class="btn primary" href="/books/user-transformer-vwdsua-1479.html">返回书籍总览</a>
        
        <button id="retry-btn" class="btn" type="button">重开本关</button>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <script>
    (() => {
      const rounds = [{"title":"回合一：缩放因子的去留","situation":"你在白板上写下Attention公式，队员追问：为什么点积后要除以sqrt(d_k)？时间只够保留一个解释版本。","prompt":"你决定采用哪种讲法作为第一锚点？","knowledgeHint":"可保守表述为：缩放有助于控制点积幅度，避免softmax过早饱和，从而让训练信号更稳定；不需要编造具体数值门槛。","optionA":{"stance":"机制优先","label":"保留缩放步骤，并强调其稳定训练分布的作用","feedback":"小队理解到这是设计上的“数值稳态护栏”，即便没有额外统计，也能建立合理认知边界。","effects":{"stability":5,"treasury":-1,"reform":4}},"optionB":{"stance":"简化优先","label":"弱化缩放细节，只说“点积后直接softmax”","feedback":"讲解更快，但队员后续容易困惑为何训练会变敏感，概念链条出现断层。","effects":{"stability":-4,"treasury":2,"reform":-3}}},{"title":"回合二：单头直冲还是多头协同","situation":"你准备示意图时，团队建议把多头机制压缩成“一个更大的注意力头”，以节省讲解成本。","prompt":"你如何定义第二阶段教学策略？","knowledgeHint":"保守可讲：多头注意力让模型在不同表示子空间并行关注关系，是结构设计要点；无需声称每个头有固定语义分工。","optionA":{"stance":"结构忠实","label":"保留多头并行视角，说明“子空间分工”的设计动机","feedback":"队员接受了“并行观察同一句子”的直观隐喻，对Transformer差异化能力形成初步把握。","effects":{"stability":4,"treasury":-2,"reform":5}},"optionB":{"stance":"成本压缩","label":"改讲单头注意力，暂不展开多头机制","feedback":"课程更短，但核心创新被削弱，后续理解编码器层内部结构会变吃力。","effects":{"stability":-3,"treasury":3,"reform":-4}}},{"title":"回合三：总装方案抉择","situation":"晨会前最后十分钟，你必须给出总结构叙事：是坚持“纯注意力+位置编码+编码器-解码器堆叠”，还是混入RNN/CNN作类比主轴。","prompt":"你拍板哪条主线进入最终课件？","knowledgeHint":"依据已给来源，最稳妥表述是：Transformer主干依赖自注意力并通过位置编码补充序列顺序信息，再由编码器-解码器堆叠完成建模。","optionA":{"stance":"原论文主线","label":"采用“自注意力主干 + 位置编码 + Encoder-Decoder Stack”的完整叙事","feedback":"战役方案形成闭环：从算子到系统层次一致，且严格贴合现有证据范围。","effects":{"stability":6,"treasury":-1,"reform":6}},"optionB":{"stance":"混合叙事","label":"将RNN/CNN作为并列主干混入主讲线，弱化“移除循环与卷积”","feedback":"短期上更“熟悉”，但与论文关键立场冲突，学员容易误判Transformer的核心革新。","effects":{"stability":-5,"treasury":1,"reform":-6}}}];
      const state = { i: 0, stability: 50, treasury: 50, reform: 50 };
      const titleEl = document.getElementById("round-title");
      const situationEl = document.getElementById("round-situation");
      const promptEl = document.getElementById("round-prompt");
      const hintEl = document.getElementById("round-hint");
      const reportEl = document.getElementById("report");
      const logEl = document.getElementById("event-log");
      const optA = document.getElementById("opt-a");
      const optB = document.getElementById("opt-b");
      const optAStance = document.getElementById("opt-a-stance");
      const optAEffect = document.getElementById("opt-a-effect");
      const optALabel = document.getElementById("opt-a-label");
      const optBStance = document.getElementById("opt-b-stance");
      const optBEffect = document.getElementById("opt-b-effect");
      const optBLabel = document.getElementById("opt-b-label");
      const debriefEl = document.getElementById("debrief");
      const endActionsEl = document.getElementById("end-actions");
      const retryBtn = document.getElementById("retry-btn");
      const sV = document.getElementById("s-v");
      const tV = document.getElementById("t-v");
      const rV = document.getElementById("r-v");
      const sB = document.getElementById("s-b");
      const tB = document.getElementById("t-b");
      const rB = document.getElementById("r-b");

      function clamp(v) {
        return Math.max(0, Math.min(100, Math.round(v)));
      }

      function fmtDelta(v, label) {
        const n = Number(v) || 0;
        const sign = n > 0 ? "+" : "";
        return label + " " + sign + n;
      }

      function effectSummary(effects) {
        return [
          fmtDelta(effects?.stability, "稳"),
          fmtDelta(effects?.treasury, "资"),
          fmtDelta(effects?.reform, "推")
        ].join(" · ");
      }

      function refreshBars() {
        sV.textContent = String(state.stability);
        tV.textContent = String(state.treasury);
        rV.textContent = String(state.reform);
        sB.style.width = state.stability + "%";
        tB.style.width = state.treasury + "%";
        rB.style.width = state.reform + "%";
      }

      function pushLog(text) {
        const li = document.createElement("li");
        li.textContent = text;
        logEl.prepend(li);
        while (logEl.children.length > 8) {
          logEl.removeChild(logEl.lastChild);
        }
      }

      function showFinal() {
        titleEl.textContent = "场景结算";
        situationEl.textContent = "你已完成本关全部关键抉择。";
        promptEl.textContent = "回看你的日志，检查你是否始终沿着同一因果逻辑推进。";
        hintEl.textContent = "复盘建议：提炼一条可迁移到现实的判断规则。";
        optA.style.display = "none";
        optB.style.display = "none";
        debriefEl.classList.add("show");
        endActionsEl.classList.add("show");
      }

      function paintRound() {
        const round = rounds[state.i];
        if (!round) {
          showFinal();
          return;
        }
        titleEl.textContent = round.title || ("抉择 " + (state.i + 1));
        situationEl.textContent = round.situation || "局势正在发生变化。";
        promptEl.textContent = round.prompt || "";
        hintEl.textContent = "知识锚点：" + (round.knowledgeHint || "先识别约束，再判断代价。");
        optAStance.textContent = round.optionA?.stance || "方案 A";
        optALabel.textContent = round.optionA?.label || "选项 A";
        optAEffect.textContent = "预期影响：" + effectSummary(round.optionA?.effects || {});
        optBStance.textContent = round.optionB?.stance || "方案 B";
        optBLabel.textContent = round.optionB?.label || "选项 B";
        optBEffect.textContent = "预期影响：" + effectSummary(round.optionB?.effects || {});
        optA.style.display = "";
        optB.style.display = "";
      }

      function applyChoice(option) {
        const effects = option?.effects || {};
        state.stability = clamp(state.stability + (Number(effects.stability) || 0));
        state.treasury = clamp(state.treasury + (Number(effects.treasury) || 0));
        state.reform = clamp(state.reform + (Number(effects.reform) || 0));
        refreshBars();

        const choiceLabel = option?.label || "未命名策略";
        const outcome = option?.feedback || "你完成了一次关键抉择。";
        const line = "第 " + (state.i + 1) + " 回合 · 选择「" + choiceLabel + "」 · " + effectSummary(effects);
        pushLog(line);
        reportEl.textContent = "后果速报：" + outcome;

        state.i += 1;
        window.setTimeout(() => {
          paintRound();
        }, 320);
      }

      optA.addEventListener("click", () => {
        const round = rounds[state.i];
        applyChoice(round?.optionA || {});
      });
      optB.addEventListener("click", () => {
        const round = rounds[state.i];
        applyChoice(round?.optionB || {});
      });
      if (retryBtn) {
        retryBtn.addEventListener("click", () => window.location.reload());
      }

      pushLog("已进入场景：深夜作战室，投影墙循环显示论文标题与结构图。你要在晨会前给出一版“可信且不过度推断”的教学战术。");
      pushLog("角色就位：你将扮演：模型研究小队指挥官（兼课程设计者）");
      refreshBars();
